    Fixed Omnizine not healing anything (#5191)
    
    * Bring Omnizine back to its former glory
    
    makes omnizine combat viable again and restores its ability to heal airloss and toxin damage effectively by making it no longer target a random bodypart for each healingtick.
    
    This Buffs omnizine effectively from:
    0.27 Toxin per tick -> 3 Toxin per tick
    0.27 Airloss per tick -> 3 Airloss per tick
    0.27 to 3 Brute per tick (Random, depending on injury) -> 3 Brute per tick (not random)
    0.27 to 3 Burn per tick (Random, depending on injury) -> 3 Burn per tick (not random)
    
    before it would only have a 1/11 chance to heal the chest each healingtick, making the toxin and airloss healing effectively 1/11 as strong, and would be barely usable in actual fights where damage is mostly focused on individual bodyparts.
    
